<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-LUKOIL BALTIJA TOPS 1996 TURNOVER LIST.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-LUKOIL BALTIJA TOPS 1996 TURNOVER LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>LUKoil Baltija had net turnover of 164.70 million lats in 1996, topping the list of biggest companies in turnover terms, Dienas Bizness said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Baltic subsidiary of Russian oil giant LUKoil had 61.70 million lats turnover in 1995, the newspaper added.</p>
<p>The 1996 showing of LUKoil Baltija made runners up of earlier leaders Latvian Shipping and Latvenergo. They had turnover of 161.28 million lats and 154.33 million lats respectively.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
